            "review_title": "Review at King BBQ Floor 4, Thiso Mall Dist.2",
            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary21025 contributions\n1\nKorean lunch\nMay 2024 • Friends\nFirst time in Korean BBQ 🍖 buffet in Thiso Mall. Second time in this chain. Bibimbap for lunch 🥙, place on 4th floor shopping mall, parking in underground garages. Enjoyed the Korean cuisine after longer time. This is BBQ place where you normally order meat 🥩 and seafood 🦞 They will prepare BBQ in front of you\nInsider tip:\nBBQ is best with three of more people\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 27, 2024",
